License decision pending

This repository remains private. No license is granted for the project-owned
code, rules, data, documentation, or knowledge assets until the product owner
gives written approval.

The prepared public-release candidates are:

- project-owned software: AGPL-3.0-or-later;
- project-owned rule data, method documentation, and non-software knowledge
  structures: CC BY-SA 4.0;
- third-party material: its original license and notice.

Candidate license references are stored in LICENSES/. Their presence is not an
authorization to publish this repository. Restricted, sealed, confidential,
personal, or redistribution-unclear material is excluded from any candidate
public release.
